  "open_items": [
    "An interrupted preparation without a complete durable journal remains an untouched conflict; automatic cleanup cannot infer ownership from unverified remnants. Existing project edits invalidate init replay without deleting data. Journal consistency is not authentication of a deliberately reconstructed foreign record.",
    "The native implementation is currently Linux/local-filesystem only; other platform, filesystem and complete release coverage remain open. Advisory mutexes do not sandbox noncooperating host writers.",
    "Parent directories must already exist. Whole bootstrap inputs and inventory are memory-resident. Full later document/project semantic gates are not implemented by initialization.",
    "15.e.C extraction cleanup remains open. Native Linux W/R extraction behavior is covered by the added behavior cases; existing init checks and all preceding scope limits remain unchanged.",
    "18.v: fresh stage-specific Apply evidence is required. Dev only prepared the implementation, behavioral oracles and pure collection; no behavior tests ran in Dev."
  ],
  "oracle": {
    "kind": "behavior",
    "requirement_contract": "Ein Root-Erzeugungsbefehl MUSS die Zielvorbedingung nach 11.7 prüfen und darf nur die vollständig geprüfte und dauerhaft abgeschlossene Root-Struktur als veröffentlicht bestätigen; ab Schutzbeginn bleibt ein Fehler-/Abbruchbestand nach C.2.2 gesperrt erhalten, ohne Rücknahme oder Vervollständigung.",
    "scope": "Complete guarded root publication under 11.7/C.2.2. Interrupted partial bytes remain protected and are never completed or rolled back by reentry. Stage-specific Apply evidence is required. 18.v binds the replacement interruption/normal-completion oracles; old automatic-repair evidence is historical only. Further plan scopes and release acceptance remain separate."
  },
  "preconditions": [
    "Owned temporary directories; native Linux descriptor-relative reads, inode flock and renameat2 no-replace publication. Built module/zipapp cases use actual independently built distribution bytes in fresh isolated processes.",
    "Use only owned native test roots with actual backup/original evidence. No historical success record authorizes replay or restoration of a protected partial publication."
  ],
